      "english": "Honor the Elders "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "… “Evameva kho, bhikkhave, appakā te sattā ye kule jeṭṭhāpacāyino; atha kho eteva bahutarā sattā ye kule ajeṭṭhāpacāyinoti …pe…. ",
      "english": "“… the sentient beings who honor the elders in the family are few, while those who don’t are many. …” "
    },
